{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Grill\u2019d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_01.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/manor.png?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_02.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/connect.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover clues, think about their relationships, <strong>and make connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each connection reveals new evidence, bringing you closer to the hidden truth behind the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_03.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every evening at dinner time, everyone gathers in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You dine with others, engage in conversation, and cast suspicion on one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/dinner.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe carefully\u2014the line between truth and lies will be revealed at this feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_04.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been granted special authority by the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this manor, where neither police nor judge exist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>only you possess the power to judge the suspects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/grill.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scoop out the hidden contradictions in their statements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">poke at their lies until every deception is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn away every lie until only the truth remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_05.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As food runs low, fear takes hold, suspicion grows\u2014and people vanish one by one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you uncover every hidden secret and safely escape the manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346340?t=1741718193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346340?t=1741718193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/5a5b6f910e95e4860128537ecf30c13c4925677d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741718193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/5a5b6f910e95e4860128537ecf30c13c4925677d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741718193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3579260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Grill\u2019d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_01.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/manor.png?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_02.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/connect.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover clues, think about their relationships, <strong>and make connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each connection reveals new evidence, bringing you closer to the hidden truth behind the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_03.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every evening at dinner time, everyone gathers in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You dine with others, engage in conversation, and cast suspicion on one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/dinner.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe carefully\u2014the line between truth and lies will be revealed at this feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_04.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been granted special authority by the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this manor, where neither police nor judge exist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>only you possess the power to judge the suspects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/grill.gif?t=1741718193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scoop out the hidden contradictions in their statements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">poke at their lies until every deception is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn away every lie until only the truth remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/image_en_05.png?t=1741718193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As food runs low, fear takes hold, suspicion grows\u2014and people vanish one by one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you uncover every hidden secret and safely escape the manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["The Yellow Room"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/84ea53c744644e91806b973de2645f3f8d555324/header.jpg?t=1741718193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257072964,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072964/movie480.mp4?t=1732171343","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072964/movie_max.mp4?t=1732171343"},"name":"Grilld","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257072964/9b38ac01d029e91883ed0d0c4258ccb952b0923b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732171343","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072964/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1732171343","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co